vela-apps — Third-Party Component Notices
==========================================

vela-apps is a composite work. It combines code written for the riscv-vela
project with a fork of the Keystone Enclave project and several vendored
third-party libraries.

Scope of the top-level LICENSE
------------------------------
The top-level LICENSE file (BSD-3-Clause) is the default license for this
repository. It reflects the license of the Keystone Enclave project, from
which sdk/, runtime/ and examples/ are derived, and it names the riscv-vela
copyright holders for the work contributed by this project:

  * Electronics and Telecommunications Research Institute (ETRI)
  * Chungbuk National University, Computer Systems Lab

Work contributed by the riscv-vela project is jointly owned by the two
institutions above and is contributed under the license already in force for
the tree it was added to, so that each tree remains uniformly licensed.

Where a component directory carries its own license file, that file governs
the contents of that directory and takes precedence over the top-level
LICENSE. Per-file SPDX-License-Identifier tags, where present, are
authoritative and take precedence over both.


