5. sdk/src/verifier/ed25519/ and sdk/include/verifier/ed25519/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Component     : ed25519 signature implementation
Upstream      : https://github.com/orlp/ed25519
Form          : Vendored copy, inherited from upstream Keystone
License       : Zlib
License text  : sdk/src/verifier/ed25519/license.txt
Copyright     : Copyright (c) 2015 Orson Peters <orsonpeters@gmail.com>

Notes         : The upstream license text was not retained when this library
                was vendored into Keystone. It has been recovered from
                upstream and restored at the path above, as required by
                clause 3 of the Zlib license.

                The files as vendored here are substantively altered: the
                hash function was changed from SHA-512 to SHA-3, so the
                signatures are not interoperable with upstream ed25519 or
                RFC 8032. Per clause 2 of the Zlib license, this is marked
                in sdk/src/verifier/ed25519/MODIFICATIONS.

                This directory is NOT covered by sdk/LICENSE.


